emand varies by about 30% and the plans are fixed in advance, so stock drifts. A safety margin above average demand pays off.\n- Warehouse capacity (184) and cash (2280) should only become a constraint under very heavy over-ordering.\n\n**Ranking.**\n- Candidates 2 and 5 order at or below average demand, so they will run short often. They are most likely in the bottom half.\n- Candidate 6 saves about 17 in order fees per pair of days. But it holds roughly the second day's demand for an extra night, which costs about 35 × 0.9 + 16 × 0.8 ≈ 44. Larger batches also make capacity losses more likely. It is likely in the bottom half.\n- That leaves five candidates (0, 1, 3, 4, 7) competing for four places. Candidate 1 has the smallest margin, while candidate 4 adds an early buffer that will probably help. I rate 0, 3, 4 and 7 slightly above 1."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5056, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5056}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:33:42.105Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWDfqsGLHGaHFsveESD9"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01FxQPCJU1qG4YJoPasr35pg", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWDfrJJjmreh6kaQDKUs", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01FxQPCJU1qG4YJoPasr35pg", "name":